<span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98375\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らはキリストの<ruby>福音<rp>(</rp><rt>ふくいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>全世界<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんせかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>広<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们把福音传遍全世界</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ビタミン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">维生素</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227427\">オレンジはビタミンを<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>含<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">橙子的维他命含量很高</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ビニール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">乙烯基；塑料；黑胶唱片</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197457\">ビニールは<ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>ねつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>弱<rp>(</rp><rt>よわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのが<ruby>難点<rp>(</rp><rt>なんてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">乙烯基的弱点在于它很容易受到热量的影响。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">美容</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">びよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">美貌；容貌；美的外表；美的五官；美化；美容护理；美容文化；化妆品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" d